SUMMARY:Jamie deRoy & Friends
LOCATION:Birdland Jazz Club\, Hell's Kitchen
DESCRIPTION:Birdland is happy to announce that Hostess/producer Jamie deRoy
 
 will be bringing her multi-MAC Award-winning Variety Show\, Jamie deRoy & 
 
friends back to the historic stage on Monday\, November 23 at 7pm. Proceeds
 
 from the evening will benefit The Entertainment Community Fund: Jamie deRo
 
y & friends Cabaret Initiative. Special guests to be announced This colorfu
 
l cabaret series has been thrilling New York audiences for the past 30+ yea
 
rs and serves as the basis for deRoy's award-winning cable television show 
 
which highlights Broadway\, Off-Broadway\, cabaret\, and showcases talented
 
 performers appearing around town. Director for the event will be Barry Kle
 
inbort\, Musical Director will be Christopher Denny\, with Tom Hubbard on b
 
ass. Jamie deRoy has won 12 Tony Awards\, nine MAC Awards\, four Back Stage
 
 Bistro Awards and 11 Telly Awards for her extensive work on both stage and
 
 screen. She has headlined at many of New York's major venues. She has also
 
 produced nine CDs in the Jamie deRoy & friends series\, all of which are a
 
vailable on Harbinger and PS Classics labels. Jamie November 23 at 7 PM Bir
 
dland\, 315 West 44 Street\, NYC www.BirdlandJazz.com or 212-581-3080 Ticke
 
ts & info: https://www.ticketweb.com/event/jamie-deroy-friends-birdland-jaz
 
z-club-tickets/14316474
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/jamie-deroy-friends-birdland-jazz-club-
 
tickets/14316474
END:VEVENT
